  "materials": {},
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "architecture",
      "title": "从 codex exec 进入核心运行时",
      "objectives": [
        "指出 CLI、exec 客户端、app-server 与 core Session 的职责边界。",
        "在固定提交中从入口追到 turn/start 请求和核心输入提交。"
      ],
      "priorKnowledge": [
        "会读函数调用和异步流程；了解 Rust 模块、Arc 与 Result 的基本写法。"
      ],
      "prerequisiteLessons": [],
      "concepts": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "本章选择本机、非交互的 codex exec 普通用户任务路径。CLI 的 Exec 分支整理参数后调用 codex_exec::run_main；本章不把该路径推广为默认 TUI 或远端执行路径。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "cli-route",
            "entry"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "本机 exec 使用 InProcessAppServerClient 启动内嵌 app-server。exec 客户端发送 thread/start 和 turn/start 请求，而核心 Session 在服务器后方处理输入与轮次。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "embedded-server",
            "thread-start",
            "turn-request",
            "turn-submit"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sourceReading": [
        "cli-route",
        "entry",
        "embedded-server",
        "thread-start",
        "turn-request",
        "request-route",
        "turn-start",
        "turn-submit",
        "thread-api",
        "thread-forward",
        "submission"
      ],
      "keySymbols": [
        {
          "name": "run_main",
          "sourceRef": "entry"
        },
        {
          "name": "start_thread",
          "sourceRef": "thread-start"
        },
        {
          "name": "turn_start",
          "sourceRef": "turn-start"
        },
        {
          "name": "start_or_steer_turn",
          "sourceRef": "thread-api"
        },
        {
          "name": "submit_turn_input",
          "sourceRef": "submission"
        }
      ],
      "execution": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "CLI 的 Exec 分支继承公共选项并把配置传给 run_main，客户端按配置准备后建立内嵌服务连接。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "cli-route",
            "embedded-server"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "start_thread 发送 ClientRequest::ThreadStart。本章研究新任务的普通路径；恢复、分叉和远端路径需要各自继续取证。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "thread-start"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "UserTurn 分支构造 TurnStartParams，将输入项和 thread_id 放入 ClientRequest::TurnStart。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "turn-request"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "app-server 将 TurnStart 路由给 turn_start，经 turn_start_inner 构造 TurnInputRequest，并调用 thread.start_or_steer_turn。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "request-route",
            "turn-start",
            "turn-submit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "CodexThread 先解析输入并检查启动容量，再调用 SessionIo.submit_turn_input，把请求包装成 SubmissionOp::TurnInput 交给会话队列并等待应答。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "thread-api",
            "thread-forward",
            "submission"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "calls": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "已核对的前半条调用链是 CLI Exec → codex_exec::run_main → 内嵌服务 → TurnStart → turn_start → turn_start_inner。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "cli-route",
            "entry",
            "embedded-server",
            "turn-request",
            "request-route",
            "turn-start"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "后半条提交链是 start_or_steer_turn → submit_turn_input_with_mode → submit_resolved_turn_input_with_mode → SessionIo.submit_turn_input。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "thread-api",
            "thread-forward",
            "submission"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "scenario": "教学场景：开发者希望用本机 codex exec 解释仓库内一个纯函数，并在终端获得答复。本平台只阅读这个请求的公开实现，不运行 Codex、不发送模型请求，也不读取你的凭据。命令、输入和目标用于理解调用关系。",
      "designRationale": [
        {
          "kind": "inference",
          "text": "exec 把任务提交与核心轮次分开，说明终端交互和运行时通过请求边界协作；这是从内嵌客户端及提交接口推导的职责划分。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "turn-request",
            "turn-submit",
            "submission"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "advice",
          "text": "独立设计 Harness 时，可先把用户入口、任务提交和执行循环分层，再决定是否需要服务协议；不要仅凭入口函数名猜测整条路径。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "cli-route",
            "turn-request",
            "submission"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "faq": [
        {
          "question": "codex exec 直接在 CLI main 里执行 Agent 循环吗？",
          "answer": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "text": "这条本机路径先进入 exec 客户端，经内嵌 app-server 的请求进入核心会话；CLI 的分发片段本身没有执行核心采样循环。",
            "sourceRefs": [
              "cli-route",
              "embedded-server",
              "turn-request",
              "turn-submit"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "这里讲的是 Codex 桌面应用全部内部实现吗？",
          "answer": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "text": "不是。本章证据只覆盖 openai/codex 公开仓库这一固定提交中的本机 exec 普通任务路径，不能据此推出桌面应用或服务端的全部实现。",
            "sourceRefs": [
              "cli-route",
              "entry",
              "embedded-server"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
