            "sourceRefs": [
              "turn-request",
              "request-route",
              "turn-submit"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "summary": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "读入口要同时查看客户端请求和服务器消费位置，才能解释用户输入怎样到达核心。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "turn-request",
            "turn-submit",
            "submission"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "每次学习都固定到本课程的 Codex 仓库与提交；本章没有引用其他项目的实现。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "cli-route",
            "entry"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-loop",
      "title": "一次用户任务怎样驱动模型轮次？",
      "objectives": [
        "从提交队列追踪到 RegularTask 和 run_turn。",
        "指出历史进入模型请求的位置，以及后续工作影响继续采样的条件。"
      ],
      "priorKnowledge": [
        "已理解客户端与核心之间的输入提交边界；了解队列、Future 与取消令牌。"
      ],
      "prerequisiteLessons": [
        "architecture"
      ],
      "concepts": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "submit_turn_input 用 oneshot 应答配合会话提交队列；队列消费 TurnInput 时调用 turn_input::handle，再把处理结果发回 reply。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "submission",
            "queue-dispatch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "普通任务进入 RegularTask。run_turns 调用 run_turn，并在终止错误、预算耗尽、采样中断或没有待处理输入等条件下结束这层任务处理。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "regular-spawn",
            "regular-turn"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sourceReading": [
        "submission",
        "queue-dispatch",
        "input-dispatch",
        "input-admission",
        "regular-spawn",
        "regular-turn",
        "turn-entry",
        "sampling-input",
        "continuation",
        "stop-gate"
      ],
      "keySymbols": [
        {
          "name": "submit_turn_input",
          "sourceRef": "submission"
        },
        {
          "name": "start_or_steer",
          "sourceRef": "input-admission"
        },
        {
          "name": "run_turns",
          "sourceRef": "regular-turn"
        },
        {
          "name": "run_turn",
          "sourceRef": "turn-entry"
        }
      ],
      "execution": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "会话队列取出 SubmissionOp::TurnInput，将 request、mode 和提交 ID 交给输入处理模块。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "queue-dispatch",
            "input-dispatch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "start_or_steer 区分输入类别并提取线程设置与启动选项；普通新任务的接纳分支把显式输入整理为 task_input，随后 spawn_task 创建 RegularTask。正在运行时的 steering 是另一条分支，不等于每条输入都新建任务。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "input-admission",
            "regular-spawn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
